ami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"title":"Interaction_PinchView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a rounded triangle. A magnification (pinch) gesture feeds the shape’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"), gated by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" paging; releasing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}]}}}